uro; 0x19 → SM→C3), em vez de herança. - **D2 — `MuCipher`** como módulo de cifra única; `XorData` vira a única porta de XOR. - **D3 — God file → 5 módulos** (`WinsockHooks`, `PacketReassembler`, `CommandChannel`/`PacketChannel`, `PacketInjector`, `NameRewriter`). - **D4 — `DebugTools`** sai do `AttackModule`. - **D5 — `GameMemory`** em sub-grupos. - **D6 — Remover** (não arquivar) a família PS.dll + rascunho + fila de skill. ## ⚠️ 2 pontos para você confirmar antes do apply 1. **D1** — porta única com `switch` (minha recomendação) **vs** hierarquia `NormalAttack`/`SkillAttack` (seu instinto original). Muda só a Fase 4/5. 2. **D5** — renomear os getters (`Player::Lev…\n- **Tools:** read_file, manage_todos, edit_file, write_file, run_command","vector":[-0.0022783717,0.05726976,-0.13250853,-0.06276644,0.05913611,-0.045848846,0.056624398,0.0038230002,-0.032728426,-0.036816664,-0.024863806,0.021300497,0.11664361,-0.019952819,-0.016407395,0.002167012,-0.011868169,-0.037923045,-0.06822434,0.0567575,0.018140802,-0.059728317,-0.035465572,-0.017224187,0.087081306,0.03291321,0.026300559,0.02646453,-0.04746894,0.0035175574,0.010028944,0.012139953,0.015667733,-0.030959379,-0.01839698,-0.021695716,0.09525125,-0.013897942,-0.0043049846,-0.02128726,-0.0041777953,-0.01632493,-0.006950985,-0.037221443,0.068804994,0.0066435114,0.082001805,-0.035051133,0.053048044,-0.09597996,0.05184942,0.027339155,0.0088645825,-0.014284369,0.05690371,0.012878498,-0.036304157,0.055478677,0.042673156,-0.039303526,0.058412325,0.05833715,0.03843596,0.094828464,0.0026580577,-0.0075125983,-0.030888781,0.034430847,-0.035696607,-0.057722043,0.0056829844,-0.0005691416,-0.00043411666,0.01937005,-0.009245194,0.025564864,-0.018624568,-0.03651714,-0.03922738,0.0060436483,0.01226919,-0.00045732653,0.12444026,-0.02390328,0.042093825,-0.008764928,0.0074292617,0.005058051,-0.038113005,0.04998512,-0.008237341,-0.055382114,0.01591507,-0.0017907049,-0.0728363,0.0132405115,-0.06027631,0.015723838,-0.034386564,-0.04072573