turas seguras da **PartyList** (slot 0 = jogador local): `PartyLife/PartyMaxLife/PartyLifePercent` | | `include/GameAddresses.h` | `PARTY_LIST_PTR = 0x81CB4E8` (party list, 32 bytes/membro) | | `potion/AutoPotion.cpp` | novo `ReadVitals()` com **3 fontes**: ObjectCharacter (memória) → PartyList (memória) → **tráfego do servidor** (`C1 26` life / `C1 27` mana, big-endian) | | `packets/PacketSniffer.cpp` | alimenta o AutoPotion com os updates de life/mana do servidor | | `core/dllmain.cpp` | o log de crash agora traz `ModuleBase` +…\n- **Tools:** read_file, search_files, glob, edit_file, run_command","vector":[0.059594873,0.044238262,-0.13613278,-0.021646947,0.05611337,-0.065863185,0.06458286,0.003511461,-0.043286562,-0.014148495,-0.0076072267,0.031004716,0.100638434,-0.038701173,0.03794565,0.0051915864,-0.021086676,-0.041661955,-0.06534755,-0.00982184,0.031618256,-0.004163691,-0.045373894,0.022635018,0.10602132,0.011279577,0.0077369222,0.086718924,-0.020161537,0.008382635,0.03661435,0.008667672,-0.0038156996,-0.050534535,0.0069994936,-0.07006226,0.02465978,0.009879107,-0.0015721541,0.022101581,0.010236325,-0.042761605,0.027531624,0.005351842,0.01110138,0.024308467,0.051199824,0.022912309,0.022759978,-0.05264937,0.06886308,-0.0074388552,-0.0027943195,-0.064586386,0.100230426,0.06344709,-0.053532172,0.028357718,0.0016498294,-0.022413436,0.10947116,0.056380928,0.012235103,0.07629951,0.0131211225,-0.010356533,-0.033780295,0.019108197,0.008905753,-0.0050495723,0.046960477,0.0030098208,0.030536344,-0.013488723,-0.013142655,0.012916205,-0.03946967,-0.00092271826,0.035359904,0.0017009448,-0.0019839178,0.042952746,0.0773977,-0.025905816,0.03196353,-0.015705856,-0.026192566,0.0034309388,-0.07019928,0.07678964,0.037153587,-0.024061866,0.040852252,0.004229318,-0.07260363,-0.0009582941,-0.06295388,0.025906064,-0.039488934,-0.003179919,-0.05119928,-0.0065453798,-0.01515909,0.037440233,-0.0012280995,0.053282164,0.0021851512,0.004757816,-0.040199462,0.009050664,0.02683117,0.05620686