042095155,-0.018506873,-0.0024570918,-0.011597264,-0.009353212,0.017882146,-0.008849398,-0.02605399,0.004975159,-0.007725467,0.010442893,-0.009740958,0.015042416,-0.026544835,0.047703046,0.032789577,0.029900055,-0.008759395,0.0032325992,-0.0072880406,0.0075977617,0.018244216,-0.017120173,-0.048033644,0.036070216,-0.029902415,0.013123569,0.006538005,0.0047295513,0.008345834,-0.034849938,0.010045029,0.02161989,0.027820176,-0.014698012,-0.05325818,-0.018622624,0.0012239143,-0.022743432,-0.004235314,-0.01650506,-0.0034475564,-0.0217324,0.010425662,-0.049903266,-0.04035178,0.0682069,0.0033511608,0.0090883095,-0.041935943,0.0025220918,-0.03871423,-0.0033786644,-0.033669192,0.04091996,-0.023095911,0.031019948,0.006229476,0.008924809,-0.031120185,0.0025981127,0.0034853562,-0.029624287,0.07274407,-0.030048545,-0.021352993,0.046278,0.014585823,0.009226929,-0.031367436,0.024948433,0.1265234,0.018488882,0.0023183806,-0.09368009,0.040756714,0.020651402,0.010536549,-0.07138035,-0.011672693,0.012968997],"hash":"9445945:2123","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T11:47:32.759Z\n- **User:** [2026-11-16 03:33:02] [PACKETHANDLER] RECV linha (13): [POTION_STOP| ] [2026-11-16 03:33:02] [POTION] auto-potion DESLIGADO [2026-11-16 03:33:02] [ATTACK] SkillAttack: entityIndex=0x0278 compositeIdx(OFF_INDEX)=0x0278 objId(OFF_ID)=0x000A slotIndex=1 skill=0x003D [2026-11-16 03:33:02] [ATTACK] SkillAttack: plain=[C1 07 19 00 3D 02 78 ] -> PacketInjector::Inject [2026-11-16 03:33:02] [PACKETSNIFFER] InjectSkillC1: after XorData [C1 07 19 E7 C2 E3 5E ] [2026-11-16 03:33:02] [PACKETSNIFFER] InjectS…\n- **Outcome:** **Achei a causa raiz real do \"não tá usando os pot\"** — não era o slot, era que **o tráfego S→C nunca era decifrado**. ## Por quê `HookConnect` redireciona o jogo para `127.0.0.1` (MuProxy2) mas **mantém a porta** → `getpeername` devolve `44411`, que está **fora** do range hardcoded (`55901-55950`). Logo `IsGameServerSocket()` = `false` → o `LogRaw` não decifrava nada → o reassembler recebia lixo → **nenhum pacote era reconstruído**. Provas no seu log: - `SEND ?? 8 bytes` → header ilegível = tráfego **não** decifrado (`??` só aparece quando `isGS==false`). - **ZERO** linhas `S->C #` → o callback de RECV nunca rodou → nenhum life/mana, nenhum inventário, nenhum character info. O auto-potion não tinha *nada* com que trabalhar. ## O que mudei | Onde | O quê | |---|---| | `MuCipher.cpp:141` | `PeekDecodedPacketSize()` — detecta header MU válido **pelo conteúdo** (não pela porta) | | `GameServerConnection.cpp:73` | `MarkIfGameServerSocket()` — socket do GS por dados | | `GameServerConnection.cpp:39` | `SetGameplaySocket()` — o socket onde o jogo joga é o **alvo da injeção** (o servidor processa o pacote na sessão daquela conexão) | | `PacketSniffer.cpp:206` | usa a detecção por dados no `LogRaw` | | `AutoPotion.cpp:553` | novo `OnServerPacket()`: **F3 03** (character info → life/maxLife/mana/maxMana), **F3 10** (inventário → slot→item ID), **C1 26/27** (life/mana atual), incluindo corpo **C3+SimpleModulus** | | `AutoPotion.cpp` | removi o `UnXorData` do life/mana — **o servidor nã…\n- **Tools:** search_files, read_file, glob, manage_todos, edit_file, git, run_command","vector":[-0.01717338,0.03694332,-0.1415167,-0.059402023,0.056400605,-0.09584305,0.03561522,-0.0033848982,-0.0339878,-0.017700713,-0.062888585,0.030445527,0.07219975,-0.04454144,0.060620442,-0.007817059,-0.046627257,-0.031560794,-0.051595416,0.009717002,0.034001354,-0.056472402,-0.012676193,-0.02247082,0.057972286,0.022824837,0.007991925,0.05169522,-0.01812999,-0.012173502,0.07045378,-0.05073092,0.0018150077,0.0054021613,-0.019341579,-0.035688117,0.039220735,-0.062944956,-0.013226646,0.040644877,0.0035519232,0.0015450687,0.016060567,-0.020353919,-0.01364572,0.04182944,0.04990544,0.030479942,0.07103943,-0.09880435,0.013254208,-0.005715469,-0.014720099,-0.033530682,0.068014406,0.0826687,-0.0