0.022493927,0.024290197,-0.013943742,0.05656228,0.025422607,0.018237183,-0.025365893,0.04780758,0.01924399,-0.005190881,-0.0077176546,-0.0049603116,-0.039957646,0.03695014,0.0027585686,-0.023372125,-0.014257107,0.019861748,0.11328941,0.016579214,0.0032366037,-0.024227062,0.05127016,0.033576958,-0.031054283,-0.077095136,-0.05856174,-0.032102495],"hash":"1a72f58f:56","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T12:00:28.691Z\n- **User:** [2026-11-16 03:54:11] [PACKETSNIFFER] recv() ret=15 socket=1616 [2026-11-16 03:54:11] [PACKETSNIFFER] S->C #3: hdr=3 op=FFFFFFF4 len=15 [C2 00 0F F4 06 00 02 00 00 4A CC 14 00 02 CC ] [2026-11-16 03:54:14] [PACKETSNIFFER] SEND C1 4 bytes [C1 04 F4 06 ] [2026-11-16 03:54:14] [PACKETSNIFFER] SEND stack: Main.dll+0xBB3DE main.exe+0x5153 main.exe+0x4DD6 main.exe+0x4D9A main.exe+0x14CF0 main.exe+0xAC4AD main.exe+0x8484F Main.dll+0x1ACE3 main.exe+0xDADA9 main.exe+0xD34A4 main.exe+0x5DB688 KERNEL32.DLL…\n- **Outcome:** **Achei o bug que matava tudo** — e era meu, de uma linha: ```cpp // PacketSniffer.cpp — LogRaw() ReasmContext ctx = { dir, xorKey, subKey, false, s }; // ← isGameServer = false // PacketSniffer.cpp — OnReassembledPacket() if (c->isGameServer && c->dir && c->dir[0] == 'R') { // ← NUNCA entrava ViewportMap::...; SkillMap::...; AutoPotion::OnServerPacket(...); } ``` O `false` era \"o buffer já vem decifrado\", mas o consumidor lia o campo como \"isto é tráfego do GS\" → **viewport, skill map e auto-potion nunca receberam um único pacote**. Agora passa o valor real. ## Formatos reais do BlackRock (extraídos do `gg_bypass2_s2c.log`) | Pacote | Formato | Uso | |---|---|---| | `C1 26` | `type FF`, `life`=**BE** @4, `sd`=BE @7 | life atual (5 pacotes) | | `C1 27` | `mana`=BE @4, `bp`=BE @6 | mana atual (13 pacotes) | | **`C1 F3 E1`** | `CurHP, MaxHP, CurMP, MaxMP, CurBP, MaxBP, CurSD, MaxSD` — **DWORD LE** | **maxLife/maxMana** (30 pacotes) | | `C1 F3 E0` | `Level, LevelUpPoint, Exp(4), NextExp(4), Str, Agi, Vit, Ene, Leadership, Life, MaxLife, Mana, MaxMana` — **WORD LE** | character info | | `C1 F3 11` | `[count][ListType][index(1) skill(2 LE) level(1)]*` | lista de skills ✓ (já batia: 0x3D = a skill do auto-ataque) | | `C1 F3 E2` | `count` + entradas (HP dos alvos) | health bar | | `C1 11` | índice `32 DA` = **o jogador**, `ViewHP`=DWORD LE @payload+9 | dano no jogador | O `F3 E1` é do **jogador local** (confirmei: `CurHP` casa com o `ViewHP` do pacote de dano `0x11` do índice `0x32D…\n- **Tools:** search_files, read_file, edit_file, write_file, run_command, manage_todos","vector":[0.025347954,0.036358826,-0.14824612,-0.058335647,0.07505324,-0.09775931,0.032737385,-0.0032202427,-0.060336687,-0.040256646,-0.060901627,0.034120042,0.07016137,-0.03160957,0.018730655,-0.009252428,-0.0402088,-0.049809102,-0.04266381,-0.014025053,0.026630107,-0.05137027,0.015684308,-0.0074631576,0.09583202,0.030164752,-0.0054670046,0.030488275,-0.056811623,-0.007510196,0.079294495,-0.023193544,-0.018351292,-0.06637875,-0.0037048638,-0.05282902,0.034897223,-0.07790613,-0.0010632144,0.040352315,0.00037578034,-0.04629913,0.018402832,-0.021667004,-0.012120113,0.008889859,0.08252563,0.06353884,0.025409833,-0.09776966,0.023055635,0.016832216,-0.030293413,-0.016404163,0.067577094,0.045161583,-0.05019404,0.050751753,0.031382352,-0.020919612,0.10009511,0.031742044,0.021747647,0.082297854,0.018601308,0.034083955,-0.058252085,0.05622667,-0.045584183,0.004051853,0.045480646,-0.027164396,0.016284365,0.022305248,-0.0008346488,0.009934603,-0.04426241,-0.048569262,-0.017070547,0.0020550399,-0.02527161,0.028835082,0.027968464,-0.055079274,0.03329778,0.00008701427,-0.011848908,0.045030687,-0.037828114,0.084975526,-0.0031558177,-0.0013147686,0.062319,0.0019841348,-0.07251096,0.04588022,-0.028291782,0.039753933,-0.0069520166,-0.012933555,-0.023274677,0.0024692544,0.033702753,-0.023040911,-0.0039382395,0.06504702,0.019400535,0.038441066,-0.011