3617475,-0.021762969,0.027032526,-0.010881239,0.09469314,-0.0043221945,0.004421395,-0.048255615,0.039012186,0.039001264,-0.018655617,-0.066176444,-0.018697046,0.010168871],"hash":"61e57154:2145","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## Consolidated Summary (updated 2026-11-16T13:37:50.529Z)\n- **Refatoração concluída** em 9 commits (`c92afdc`…`6846467`), mantendo comportamento. Módulos em `src/`/`src/include/`: `MuCipher`, `DebugTools`, `NameRewriter`, `PacketReassembler`, `PacketInjector`, `CommandChannel`, `PacketChannel`, `WinsockHooks` e `GameMemory`.\n- **Correções locais ainda não commitadas:** checksum de `SimpleModulusCipher::EncryptBlock`; pipeline de auto-potion `C3+SM`; crashes em `GameMemory::Player::UserObject()`/`Character()`; `src/include/SafeRead.h` com validação `VirtualQuery`, aplicado a leituras de objetos, stats, `PartyList` e viewport.\n- **Causa raiz do auto-potion corrigida:** `PacketSniffer.cpp::LogRaw()` inicializava `ReasmContext.isGameServer=false`; o consumidor entendia isso como “já decifrado”, mas usava o campo como indicador de tráfego GS. Viewport, skill map e `AutoPotion::OnServerPacket()` nunca recebiam pacotes. O valor real agora é passado.\n- **Protocolos BlackRock confirmados:** `C1 26` (life), `C1 27` (mana), `C1 F3 E1` (HP/MP/SD máximos em DWORD LE), `C1 F3 E0` (character info), `C1 F3 11` (skills), `C1 F3 E2` (HP de alvos) e `C1 11` (dano/viewport).\n- **Rede/logging:** `MuCipher.cpp::PeekDecodedPacketSize()` detecta headers MU; `GameServerConnection.cpp` identifica socket GS/destino de gameplay; `PacketSniffer.cpp` usa a detecção. `PacketDiag.cpp` foi adicionado ao `build.bat`. Log em `F:\\blackrockmu\\gg_bypass2_s2c.log` captura até 400 pacotes S→C, corpos C3 decodificados e histogramas de opcodes.\n- **Auto-potion:** `AutoPotion.cpp::OnServerPacket()` trata `F3 03`, `F3 10` e `C1 26/27`; aceita slots manuais ou IDs hex, source/target distintos, polling de 100 ms e comandos `POTION_START/STOP/CONFIG/STATUS`.\n- **Debug:** TCP `44412` (comandos) e `44413` (logging/injeção); comandos `ATTACK_DUMP`, `HEXDUMP`, `SCANVALUE`, `SCANSLOT`, `DIRSCAN`; sniffer registra 30 pacotes S→C. Build via `build.bat` com `/EHsc` e `/MAP`, gerando `byp.dll`.\n- **Pendências:** recompilar/implantar e validar em `F:\\blackrockmu\\` com o jogo parado; confirmar life/mana; revisar `0x59C725`, `0x404E34`, `Main.dll:0x67D68330`; escolher `InjectSkillC1` ou `InjectC1Attack` em `AttackModule.cpp:207`; reduzir logs `[SM] DecryptBlock`; validar `XorData`; expor `hpslot`/`mpslot` em `MuProxy2/MainForm.cs:259`; commit das correções locais.","vector":[0.041764494,0.052296966,-0.16810252,-0.024344638,0.053338315,-0.09153295,0.054088164,0.0008624619,-0.04722124,-0.033083044,-0.054567464,0.014932021,0.037639517,-0.014638194,0.01885553,-0.041494135,-0.031086965,-0.019141411,-0.048915517,0.013169324,0.022022534,-0.08038689,-0.03881009,-0.010499481,0.09895216,0.073569626,-0.00795486,0.026627883,-0.068467215,-0.0042401743,0.050808903,0.009355741,0.012118791,-0.04762094,0.020043928,-0.041192397,0.023486946,-0.025309984,-0.029363142,0.0028908732,0.017449383,0.0035527162,-0.016079387,-0.06045567,-0.0036077255,0.034272537,0.056072477,-0.016235352,0.048324358,-0.08757139,0.06239554,0.0041076206,-0.0021463253,-0.040781014,0.0805718,0.06529035,-0.037269153,0.03908283,0.018680869,-0.051741254,0.06547682,0.003592062,-0.005882669,0.050968874,0.01707727,0.0016926127,-0.049278673,0.071851686,-0.05744759,0.01291972,0.026117537,-0.025865372,0.027949408,-0.012837918,0.01767551,0.010782975,-0.04458697,-0.04105787,0.02741522,-0.0077727973,0.0045186975,-0.004414513,0.09666513,-0.016425064,0.046453968,0.008067973,-0.03364436,0.017773328,-0.05586431,0.09129439,0.013677471,-0.037594385,0.019016042,0.011259713,-0.038596876,0.034939267,-0.058073238,-0.00029823373,-0.04304678,-0.013888651,-0.028682627,0.0003680806,0.018817121,0.017295236,0.019518852,0.048448287,-0.