,0.00387097,-0.04265368,-0.014380321,0.010974552,-0.010641122,0.013913605,-0.078905284,-0.016981382,-0.00963596,0.018874615,-0.020493098,-0.033560105,0.045363683,0.0036111262,0.020787848,0.0064569316,-0.036601767,0.07248106,0.023468979,-0.0043480447,-0.0026655388,-0.019385688,-0.06138896,-0.023256255,-0.03473027,0.017468043,0.007287519,0.014175652,-0.0041979044,-0.007250093,-0.033473663,-0.013045882,-0.00067484484,-0.028111463,0.03580489,-0.030617254,-0.052955534,-0.0088704685,0.01353694,0.025600007,0.017165374,0.018423505,0.14217028,0.008070804,0.01507439,-0.033253178,0.008730244,0.010516671,-0.0020043235,-0.0671428,0.0021027823,-0.005009728],"hash":"8e1cdf49:1636","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":false},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-16T13:03:09.510Z\n- **User:** funcionou em partes. mas em um momento parou de funionar nao sei por que, avalie....\n- **Outcome:** Achei a causa raiz — e **não era** o botão \"Aplicar\". ## O diagnóstico No log, no instante em que a potion \"parou\": ``` 04:45:10 trafego: life=214(1) mana=2(1) | calc: life=214/214 mana=219/219 04:46:10 trafego: life=214(1) mana=12(1) | calc: life=4/214 mana=12/219 ← 4 de vida! 04:46:40 trafego: life=0(1) mana=44(1) | calc: life=4/214 mana=12/219 ``` **O servidor dizia que você estava com 4/214 de vida (1%) e o byp achava que você estava com 214/214 (100%)** — então o limiar de 50% nunca era atingido e a potion nunca saía. A causa está no protocolo (confirmei no source eMU em `MuEmu-master/eMU/GameServer/GameServer/Protocol.cpp:2490`): o pacote `C1 26` tem um byte **type** e o valor significa coisas diferentes: | type | significado | |---|---| | `0xFF` | vida/mana **ATUAL** | | `0xFE` | vida/mana **MÁXIMA** | | `0xFD` | atual (truncada em BYTE) | O byp ignorava o type e guardava o `0xFE` (o máximo, 214) como se fosse a vida atual → a vida \"congelava\" no máximo. Pior: `ParseCharacterCalc` (F3 E1) sobrescrevia o valor de rede com o snapshot, e as duas fontes brigavam. **E o clique em \"Aplicar\" foi coincidência:** a potion voltou às `04:43:17`, **15 segundos antes** do clique das `04:43:32` — o que destravou foi a mana cair abaixo de 30%, não o clique. ## O que mudei **`src/potion/AutoPotion.cpp`** - `C1 26/27`: agora respeita o byte `type` — `0xFE` alimenta o **máximo**, `0xFF` alimenta a **vida atual**. - Cada fonte (`F3 E1` calc vs. tráfego) tem **tick de chegada**; o módulo …\n- **Tools:** search_files, read_file, manage_todos, edit_file, run_command, glob","vector":[0.055448294,0.056970935,-0.15412977,-0.049430225,0.04030753,-0.0697286,0.06661119,-0.03181824,-0.017466892,-0.020486152,-0.040265407,-0.00041743708,0.09429197,-0.028841462,0.03349357,-0.037252672,-0.031672098,-0.068485096,-0.063293085,0.050004948,0.0050414116,-0.044625938,-0.033407256,0.009145025,0.04759613,0.056304753,-0.04637456,0.07864349,-0.041800853,-0.019659966,0.030483428,0.02020744,0.02765429,-0.018284727,-0.014727411,-0.037339125,0.06287959,0.022490097,0.052066814,0.023432475,0.010266629,-0.02769685,0.04092215,0.02499794,0.006573203,0.038750242,0.036757983,0.018381665,0.05451929,-0.061484143,0.038930077,-0.012861251,0.0057621417,-0.03184973,0.101622924,0.06513894,-0.006180387,-0.023611827,0.028835112,-0.046764184,0.09376407,0.012242198,-0.0049693557,0.095387265,0.02811152,-0.00096801383,-0.016618662,0.032335397,-0.033891357,0.002597317,0.03851682,-0.023362257,0.0038022932,0.0036369273,-0.01447548,0.012764779,-0.049686335,-0.024881598,-0.018040113,0.01857009,0.0071579106,0.010407697,0.10268349,-0.05355634,0.03356263,-0.023712508,-0.030868271,0.017245464,-0.035909597,0.096859895,0.0046568327,-0.011826261,0.042582676,-0.012137843,-0.08448842,0.029116744,-0.033539534,0.02942507,-0.0143098,0.015704907,-0.055765215,-0.0053241677,0.033481233,-0.019388983,0.025964864,0.04107275,-0.0017840144,-0.01725085,-0.050936148,-0.037977245,0.0017069192,0.015101317,-0.04528785,-0.037913654,0.025313806,-0.0072932704,0.03366312,-0.008614773,0.